 of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1434114282120145", "version": "0.2.318"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1434114282120145"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "New: the Camera (Menu > Capture > Camera). Put a camera anywhere in your room and record a video or a timelapse of your sculpting from there. Point at it and pull the trigger to move it, or hold your controller where you want it and press Snap.\r\nRecord your clay on green (or blue, pink, black or white) to key it into your own phone videos, or on your room\u2019s backdrop. What you see in the headset doesn\u2019t change.\r\nVideos go to your Quest gallery (Movies/Clayground), and Capture > Share sends them to your phone.", "created_date": 1793157527, "id": "1434114282120145", "version": "0.2.318", "version_code": 318, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1434114282120145"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "smooth fix", "created_date": 1793102228, "id": "1433489068849333", "version": "0.2.317", "version_code": 317, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1434114282120145"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Thumb shortcuts: I did both undo and tools. On the hand you don\u2019t sculpt with, slide your thumb along the side of your index finger:\r\n\r\nLeft undoes and right redoes, so an accidental undo is one swipe from coming back.\r\nForward / back steps through the eight tools, and the tool\u2019s name pops up.\r\nTap does nothing for now. It\u2019s the gesture most likely to fire by accident, and Meta says not to use it for picking things.", "created_date": 1793079879, "id": "1433254318872808", "version": "0.2.316", "version_code": 316, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1434114282120145"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Sculpting with your hands is steadier and keeps up better: the clay follows your hand, not your fingertips\u2019 wobble, so lines come out smoother and slow strokes no longer trail behind.\r\nLetting go of a pinch no longer leaves a little hook of clay at the end of the stroke.\r\nA stroke no longer breaks into beads when hand tracking drops the pinch for a moment while your fingers are still together.", "created_date": 1793074420, "id": "1433202875544619", "version": "0.2.315", "version_code": 315, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1434114282120145"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "New: sculpt together. Open SYSTEM > Together, host a room, and friends join with its code or a Meta invite, from anywhere. Up to four people, each with their own clay. The host can hide or remove anyone, and Meta\u2019s Report button works as usual.\r\nNew: your references from clayvr.com. Sign in at clayvr.com, add images under My stuff > Online > References (from your computer, or Google Drive), then press My account in References once to link this headset. From then on your images arrive whenever References opens.\r\nNew: send reference images from a PC or phone on the same Wi-Fi. In References, press Add yours, open the address it shows in any browser, and drop images. They appear straight away, newest first.\r\nA pinch with your palm turned toward you no longer sculpts. That is Quest\u2019s own menu gesture, and a tip now explains it.\r\nBig strokes are smoother: a wide Smooth or Move through open space no longer freezes the headset for a moment when it ends, and Undo holds far more of your history.", "created_date": 1793038599, "id": "1432865958911644", "version": "0.2.314", "version_code": 314, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}